Oil UI design skill

Install:
  Install the Oil UI skill if needed.

Upgrade:
  Update the installed Oil UI skill.

Status:
  Report local skill files.

Requirements:
  Ubuntu, APT and a regular user with sudo access.

Configuration:
  Source: https://github.com/oil-oil/oil-ui
  Destination: ~/.agents/skills/oil-ui
  On upgrade, an existing copy at $CODEX_HOME/skills/oil-ui becomes a link to this directory.
  CODEX_HOME defaults to ~/.codex.
  First skill backup: ${XDG_STATE_HOME:-$HOME/.local/state}/wsley/backups/.
